---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import logo from "../assets/logo.webp";
---

<Layout
  title="Sounds So Far | Nolan Haines"
  description="Sounds So Far: a racecar trailer rebuilt as a traveling studio and stage, touring Austin to Austin, March to October 2027."
>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <Image src={logo} alt="Sounds So Far Music Studio" width={88} height={88} class="logo" loading="eager" />
    <p class="by">Nolan Haines presents</p>
    <h1>Sounds So Far</h1>
    <p>A racecar trailer turned studio, rolling from Austin to Austin, March to October 2027. It stops for festivals and finds up-and-coming artists in every town. Each one plays a live set, sits down for a podcast conversation, and gets their favorite cocktail.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="/apply">Play on the trailer</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>A stage that comes to you</h2>
    <p class="lead">Most new artists wait for a stage. We bring one to them. The trailer parks, the gear goes up, and the set goes out live. The conversation lands on the podcast and the clips land on every platform after.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div><h3>Live sets</h3><p>Sets are recorded and streamed from the trailer so anyone, anywhere can watch.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Open mic between stops</h3><p>In between the big festivals, the trailer opens up. Walk up, plug in, play.</p></div>
      <div><h3>A talk and a drink</h3><p>Every artist gets a podcast interview, before or after their set, with their favorite cocktail in hand, sometimes mixed by a bartender they love. Every drink also comes in a non-alcoholic version.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Layout>
